guide forever/alliance/30-40/04b-stranglethorn-vale
title Stranglethorn Vale
faction Alliance
levels 35-36
zone Stranglethorn Vale
next forever/alliance/30-40/05-arathi-highlands
pitch For characters of 35 to 36, but several quests here are level 37-41: on purpose, for their experience. Troll Witchery's Skullsplitter trolls are 39-42, so pull them one at a time.

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Since 2026-11-07 Stranglethorn's second loop, after Desolace (the first loop is 30-40/04, which takes its Booty Bay
# quests). In from Duskwood at the north, down through the jungle, out at Booty Bay.

step Collin Mauren
  when complete 1078
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 1078                         -- In the Slaughtered Lamb, if you still carry it

step Fly to Darkshire
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"
  fly "Darkshire"
  zone Duskwood

step Stranglethorn Vale
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 40.8,4.2 "Into Stranglethorn Vale"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Rebel Camp

step Rebel Camp
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip From Duskwood take the road south; the camp sits in the hills west of the road.
  accept 207                          -- Brother Nimetz
  accept 574                          -- Sergeant Yohwa
  accept 210                          -- Corporal Kaleb: for Krazek in Booty Bay

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  tip South along the road: the hunters' tents stand just west of it.
  accept 192                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin: the Shadowmaw Panthers prowl around Lake Nazferiti, after Kurzen's Compound

step Bookie Herod
  when onquest 200
  tip East to Kurzen's Compound: Herod's records lie in a hut on its west side.
  turnin 200                          -- Bookie Herod's Records, upstairs
  accept 328

step Kurzen's Compound
  tip Headshrinkers stand deeper in the compound; the Commandos lurk stealthed around it and in the cave, and Herod's strongbox sits by the cave mouth. Pick up Green Hills pages as they drop.
  tip Careful: Kurzen Commandos are level 34-35, not elite, and often spawn stealthed; near death they use Smoke Bomb.
  kill 938 quest 574.1 @46.3,7.8 map 1434 -- Kurzen Commando
  kill 941 quest 574.2 @46.4,7.9 map 1434 -- Kurzen Headshrinker, below ground
  turnin 328                          -- Bookie Herod's Strongbox, below ground
  accept 329

step Lake Nazferiti
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip South from the compound to Lake Nazferiti: the Venture Co. Geologists in the camps on its shore carry the Tumbled Crystals, and the Shadowmaw Panthers prowl stealthed in the jungle south and east of it.
  collect 4106 quest 213 @44.5,20.5 map 1434 -- Tumbled Crystal
  kill 684 quest 192 @48.6,22.2 map 1434 -- Shadowmaw Panther

step The jungle ruins
  tip West across the jungle to the troll ruins: each holds one stone tablet of the troll legends, the first two in the ruins south-west of Nesingwary's camp, the last two on the hill in the north-west.
  collect 2005 quest 207.1            -- The First Troll Legend: Moon Over the Vale
  collect 2006 quest 207.2            -- The Second Troll Legend: Gri'lek the Wanderer; underwater

step Water Elementals
  tip The haunted island lies just off the shore west of the second tablet: the Lesser Water Elementals rise from the water around it.
  collect 3923 quest 601              -- Water Elemental Bracers

step The Ruins of Zul'Kunda
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip North along the coast to the ruins on the hill: the last two tablets lie there. Pick up Green Hills pages as they drop.
  collect 2007 quest 207.3            -- The Third Troll Legend: Fall of Gurubashi
  collect 2008 quest 207.4            -- The Fourth Troll Legend: The Emperor's Tomb
  complete 339 optional               -- Chapter I
  complete 340 optional               -- Chapter II
  complete 341 optional               -- Chapter III
  complete 342 optional               -- Chapter IV

step Rebel Camp
  tip East to the Rebel Camp, on the way back to Nesingwary's camp.
  turnin 329                          -- Lieutenant Doren
  accept 330
  turnin 330                          -- Corporal Sethman
  accept 331
  turnin 331                          -- Lieutenant Doren
  turnin 574                          -- Sergeant Yohwa: the Commandos and Headshrinkers fell in the compound
  turnin 207                          -- Brother Nimetz
  accept 205

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  turnin 339 optional                 -- Barnil Stonepot
  turnin 340 optional
  turnin 341 optional
  turnin 342 optional
  turnin 338 optional
  turnin 192                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  accept 196

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  when group 193
  accept 193

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South

step Snapjaw Crocolisks
  tip Snapjaw Crocolisks bask along the river in the middle of the jungle, on the way south to the Skullsplitter ruins.
  collect 4104 quest 577              -- Snapjaw Crocolisk Skin

step Level 36
  when level<36
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Troll Witchery's Skullsplitter trolls are 39-42. Below 36? Keep killing the Snapjaw Crocolisks along the river until level 36. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Armory) or the Razorfen Downs dungeon instead.
  goto 40.2,27.2 map 1434 "Snapjaw Crocolisk"
  level 36 grind 1152                 -- grind on Snapjaw Crocolisk

step Skullsplitter trolls
  tip The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins east of the road between Nesingwary and Grom'gol.
  collect 2466 quest 205              -- Skullsplitter Fetish

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

step Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  turnin 577                          -- Drizzlik, inside
  turnin 601                          -- Baron Revilgaz, upstairs in the tavern
  accept 602                          -- For Archmage Ansirem in Alterac Mountains
  turnin 213                          -- Kebok
  turnin 210                          -- Krazek, upstairs
  accept 627 optional -- Krazek, upstairs: this optional quest needs four Lesser Bloodstone Ore. Mine Lesser Bloodstone Deposits in Arathi Highlands with Mining 75, or buy the ore at the Auction House or ask a miner friend. The kobolds do not drop it; skip this quest if you cannot get the ore.
  accept 600                          -- Crank Fizzlebub, inside
  accept 606                          -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley, on the top floor
